Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd939x: a failed zdet ramp is a floating reading

When the impedance ramp does not complete, the measurement returned
without writing a result, and wcd939x then used a 0, which reads as a
short: headphones could be classed as mono or as a lineout.
Report the failed ramp as floating impedance, which the caller already
treats as no usable reading.

Rebased onto 7.2.6 for the Gen 3 kernel: only the wcd939x half is carried
here, the wcd938x half is already in the series (0304).
---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -2337,6 +2337,8 @@
 		dev_dbg(component->dev,
 			"%s: Impedance detect ramp error, c1=%d, x1=0x%x\n",
 			__func__, c1, x1);
+		/* no reading is not 0 ohm */
+		*zdet = WCD939X_ZDET_FLOATING_IMPEDANCE;
 		goto ramp_down;
 	}
 
